Just want to add:  be aware that converting your alignment
to neutral will have an adverse impact on your continued
ability to use certain intelligent lawful artifacts, notably
Excalibur.  This may or may not be a big deal, depending
on how far into the game you are and what other weapons
you have at your disposal.  The Eye is admittedly a rather
compelling artifact, especially if you can kit yourself out
with a robe and helm of brilliance and no other metal, for
productive casting during combat.  If you're far enough
into the game that you can spend a couple of extra turns
hitting melee-type monsters with your sword without any
risk of dying of hitpoint loss, the Eye could well be more
valuable than Excalibur; but it's an issue to be aware of.


